WWE 2K16 Android: compatible SDK patches from the other ReXGlue wrestling ports

From WWE 2K14 (Jarrod Feng, github.com/Jarrodfeng/wwe2k14-recomp, BSD-3), applied as-is:
  018-session32         lock the STFS package seek+read pair (titantron streaming while a .pac loads)
  091-session89         Win32 auto-reset event semantics on POSIX (2K14's phone pinfall freeze)
From WWE '12 PC/Android (github.com/iMrBurn/wwe12-pc), applied as-is or with small offsets:
  cores-warning, freespace, overlay, thread-name (Android start-up Scudo abort), wait-probe,
  zz-android-crash-where, zz-android-oldkernel, zz-android-stereo
From WWE '12, ported by hand to this SDK:
  android2-cpu (sub-ms waits spun a core at 100 %; POLL_SENTINEL kept the UI thread awake),
  zz-android-uiwake (the Android UI loop never sleeps more than 50 ms: lost wakeups froze loadings),
  timer-sleep (the timer thread sleeps instead of spinning: ~20 % of a core)

